WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.690
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.950
Something strange has been happening to me for a while.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:19.660
Whenever I had a really important performance, I would be so amazing it was like I was a different person.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:23.410
Hime-senpai explained it to me afterwards.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:27.170
She said that I shouldn't rely on that strange power anymore.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.760
In any case, all I can do now is follow Hime-senpai's advice and Aikatsu as hard as I can!

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.990
<i>Good. My voice sounds fine, and my throat doesn't hurt.</i>

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.240
<i>But still...</i>

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:59.280
<i>At first, I was overjoyed that I could put on shows better than I expected.</i>

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.040
<i>But as I kept doing it over and over,</i>

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>I started losing my voice after every performance.</i>

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.260
<i>What she said back then...</i>

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:18.050
<i>I've been trying not to think about it for fear of losing my ability to sing.</i>

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:25.390
Tomorrow I'm going to go and ask her to explain everything.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.160
Hime-senpai, you're really incredible.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.160
I was just thinking you'd be coming soon.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.210
Here I am.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.590
This way.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:03:59.760
Okay.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:05.050
I'm drafting up designs for my new Premium Rare Dress right now.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.760
Sorry to intrude.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:12.270
Are those them? That candy motif is fantastic!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.350
Will this be My Little Heart's winter release?

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:19.400
Yes, I'm planning to unveil it at my next solo concert.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.780
I loved your autumn Premium Rare Dress too.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.200
It's my favorite of all your dresses!

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.780
Thank you.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.500
This place has a wide variety of reference material.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.420
All of the past S4's dresses and stages

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.420
are preserved here.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.170
And this...

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.670
Was one of the first S4 members of Song Class, Yukino Hotaru.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.800
People know her as a legendary idol.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:50.680
Oh, I knew that! Rola told me.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:55.480
Didn't people used to say her voice was like a fleeting shooting star?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.810
Her real name is Moroboshi Hotaru-san.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.780
She's the Headmaster's older sister.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:03.900
Oh, that's—

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:08.780
Look closely. Can't you see the resemblance?

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:15.290
Now that you mention it, I guess she kind of does, and kind of doesn't...

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:20.670
But what does Hotaru-senpai have to do with what we were talking about?

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:26.510
You and I have both experienced performances where it felt like we were someone else.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:30.890
The first person it happened to was Hotaru-senpai.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.270
Yukino Hotaru-senpai.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:44.860
She was the top idol of her era, and everyone recognized her outstanding abilities.

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:50.450
But after a certain point, she began to rely on a mysterious power on stage.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:54.910
Then at the height of her popularity, she suddenly retired.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:02.130
To this day, she's called the illusory idol by her fans.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.880
She... retired?

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.260
She would have spells where she lost the ability to sing.{temporarily but also habitually}

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:15.520
It seems she was unable to continue her idol career due to them.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:17.270
No way...

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.560
I believe she lives a peaceful life now.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:27.450
The headmaster saw his sister's suffering more than anyone else. {I hate how my best version of this line is ambiguous, it's got me stuck}

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:35.370
So when he noticed that I was going through the same thing, he began to advise me.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.870
That's when I learned that I was the second to experience it.

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.170
And the next person...

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.500
Is me?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:48.170
Yes. The headmaster has been 
very concerned about you.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:59.980
He wanted to spare you from the same fate and prevent you from reaching the same tragic end as Hotaru-senpai.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.400
That scares me.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:08.150
Just the thought of being unable to sing...

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.700
Yume-chan.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:13.450
What am I supposed to do now?!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:19.790
Back then, all I could do was try to change myself and not rely on that strange power by focusing on my Aikatsu.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.960
It hasn't come to me since.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:28.210
Why couldn't Hotaru-senpai overcome it?

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:29.670
I don't know.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:37.220
But Yume-chan, so long as your heart is strong, 
you'll be able to surmount any difficulties you may face. {kind of a weird one}

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:39.930
Right.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.980
<i>I might lose my ability to sing.</i>

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.900
We can't hear you!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.110
Get off!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.620
<i>My voice... my voice isn't working!</i>

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.040
<i>No, I'm scared!</i>

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.130
What's wrong, Nijino?

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:07.920
Nothing!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.340
I'm sorry.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.400
<i>She didn't finish her food?!</i>

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.070
<i>What on earth happened to her?</i>

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.950
Could you not dig any deeper than you have?

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.870
All of this is for Nijino's sake.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.210
Is she going to be okay?

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.340
This hurts to watch.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.890
All set.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.690
Yume, what's wrong?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.110
Rola...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.280
Rola!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.820
Hey, Yume! Are you okay?

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.750
I see.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.580
Sorry, I don't really understand.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.880
It's too complicated for me.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.380
It means exactly what I said.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:38.890
All the times I beat you might've been because of that strange power and not my own ability.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.560
So what is that power?

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:42.850
I don't know.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:49.730
It's just that sometimes I have these amazing 
performances where don't feel like I'm myself.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.150
You told me that before.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:57.660
And if this keeps happening, 
I might lose my ability to sing.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.370
What?! Why's that?

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.830
Sorry, Rola.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:08.620
I want to forget all the competitions we had and start over from the beginning!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.790
Then bring it on!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:17.420
But hey, honestly, it really doesn't bother me how you won.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:21.010
All that stuff about some kind of power is over my head.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:26.430
You love to sing, and you've worked your hardest at it.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.400
Isn't that the most important thing?

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:34.360
I just look up to Hime-sama, and I love to sing. {all the way back in ep 1}

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:38.740
Don't you think that's the most important thing?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.740
But even more important than that is what's next.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:46.120
Our real competition, to enter S4.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.370
Yeah.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.040
As true rivals, and as best friends,

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.880
I can't help but look forward to what kind of future awaits us.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.380
Rola.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.550
You finally stopped crying.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.390
Yeah. Thanks.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.770
I'll be waiting, Yume.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.140
There's no point in having a weak rival.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:14.770
Grow stronger, become my 
Premium Rare rival, and come at me. {caps?}{I guess?}

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:27.120
<i>There are times when an idol must come to endure an unimaginably cruel tale.{I'd like to use "suffer" in the classical sense, but suffer in the modern sense exists and confusion}</i>

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:30.830
<i>But I will not permit there to be a second Yukino Hotaru.</i>

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:33.880
<i>I swear.</i>

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:38.170
<i>That is my duty as their headmaster.</i>

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:55.650
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.360
Wh-What is this?

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:06.870
Come with me.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.330
Go with you where?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.010
U-Um...

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.140
<i>Isn't this...</i>

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.440
Yes, come in.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.410
Headmaster...

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.830
And Yume-chan?

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.910
S-Sorry to intrude.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.910
I have a request for you.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:13:00.420
Let Nijino on stage as a surprise guest for your encore tonight.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:07.050
I-I couldn't possibly do that! Not for Hime-senpai's important unveiling!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:11.180
Headmaster, it's unreasonable to make that request without even a rehearsal.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.310
We cannot afford to falter!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.940
Is it because of that power?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:21.690
Please tell me! Just what is this power?!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:32.040
I believe that the power forces your latent abilities into bloom.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:37.920
Yukino Hotaru had a wealth of untapped potential as an idol.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:40.460
I suspect you two are the same.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:45.470
However, if you do not one day bloom on your own, only suffering awaits!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.930
Take the stage, Nijino!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:54.810
I'm scared.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.730
I don't want to.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:01.980
But...

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:07.490
But... I'm even more scared to give up my dream of S4. {you could've said 'I want to even less' etc}

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.160
I don't want to give up!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:17.370
Only you can find the way to overcome it yourself.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:21.000
Search for your own answer!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.670
I apologize for the sudden change.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:30.590
No, I am of the same mind as you.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:33.140
I'll do anything I can for her.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.390
I want to save Yume-chan!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:40.650
There are some things only those who share a stage can understand.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:45.150
You can accompany her to a world beyond my reach.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.200
I leave Nijino in your hands.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:48.820
Right.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.160
Everyone!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:56.160
Are you ready to have some fun?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.790
<i>It's under way.</i>

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:02.960
<i>This is an important concert for Hime-senpai.</i>

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.420
<i>I can't afford to fail, but still...</i>

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.720
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:14.430
<i>At some point, I started to rely on that power.</i>

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.400
<i>Here I am, given the chance to perform with my idol, Hime-senpai...</i>

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:32.530
<i>This is supposed to be a step toward the dream I proclaimed that day...</i>

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.160
<i>I hate feeling scared!</i>

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.050
Encore! Encore!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.590
Amazing work!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.680
Thank you.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:53.470
Three minutes until your encore.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.300
Okay!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:55.800
<b>Shiratori Hime</b>

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:59.060
I was watching, Hime-senpai.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.140
Thank you.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.520
Are you up for the encore?

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.190
Hime-senpai... I...

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.150
I'm sorry.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.080
Hime-senpai?

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:24.000
You're in so much pain, but I can't do anything for you.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.080
Th-That's not...

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.590
I understand.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.510
It was the same for me.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:37.300
I felt so insecure whenever I was alone.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.010
I know.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:41.850
Yume-chan, take these.

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:46.360
Your Premium Rare Dress?

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:50.190
Yume-chan, didn't you say you liked this dress?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:51.490
Can I really? {don't want to deal with her just using it vs now owning it}

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:52.860
Of course.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:58.370
I'll be using my winter Premium Rare Dress, the Melty Whipped Cream Coord.{we usually translate the second word right?}{ehhhhh sure whatever}

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:09.210
Wearing your favorite dress will naturally embolden you.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.630
Let's both go on in Premium Rare Dresses.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:20.810
Okay!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:35.030
<i>As a member of S4, I will become the star that lights Yume-chan's path.</i>

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.030
Yume-chan.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:42.290
No matter how scary it is, so long as I'm here, I'll never leave you alone.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.160
You have nothing to fear.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.170
Hime-senpai...

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.170
Okay.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.840
I'll rely on you.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.170
Shiratori Hime, ready to go!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.180
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:34.940
<i>Thank goodness. That strange power didn't come out today.</i>

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.950
<i>But I'm still scared.</i>

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:50.950
<i>I can't believe it might take away my song.</i>

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:55.960
<i>Will I be able to sing on my own from now on?</i>

00:21:56.790 --> 00:22:00.710
<i>Today's success was only due to Shiratori's support.</i>

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:06.880
<i>The real issue is whether Nijino will be able to stand on her own from now on.</i>

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.850
<i>I'll do everything I can.</i>

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.230
<i>Even if I'm resented for it.</i>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:19.600
<i>Restore your brilliance with your own strength!</i>

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:23.730
<i>You must overcome, Nijino Yume!{I think this sounds suitinger, but?}{how about this?}</i>

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:14.550
Nothing happened this time, thanks to Hime-senpai...

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:16.100
Yume-chan, fight!

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:18.140
No more negativity!

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:20.350
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:22.020
Beyond the Rainbow. {over the rainbow would be 'niji no kanata ni'}{https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vgseyn19M7I}

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.310
Become the first-star idol!
